OL,3,AI'm 27 and I've already written my will
OL,4,A- here's why
OL,5,
OL,6,FWriting a will is probably not on the
OL,7,Fto-do lists of most 27-year-olds.
OL,9,FBut Erin Atkinson has already decided
OL,10,Fwhat should happen to her money and
OL,11,Fbelongings when she dies.
OL,13,F"At first it felt quite surreal because
OL,14,Fyou associate wills with older people,"
OL,15,Fshe says.
OL,17,FErin works in psychological research at
OL,18,Fa London university and moved to the
OL,19,Fcapital from Bristol four years ago.
